                <note rend="inline" type="source">713.1311/258: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Lawton</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-02-28T17:00:00-05:00">February 28, 1934—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>8. Legation’s No. 19, February 26, 4 p.m. Your action in explaining the
                    Department’s position is approved.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
